WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Free, open-source cutting-room
software for garment factories.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start with a photo of your paper patterns.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Check the pieces. Make a marker.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Or start from the T-shirt block.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Grade your sizes from a size chart.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Watch the marker draw itself live.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Plan your cut.
Export plotter, DXF and PDF files.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Built with modern AI tools.
Help us improve it.
